		(property "Design notes" "Increase nominal output capacitance from 10 to 22 uF in the same 0805 footprint. 22 uF +/-20%, 25 V, X5R, 2.0 x 1.25 x 1.25 mm. REF5040A permits 1-50 uF output capacitance; even +20% tolerance and +15% temperature change give 30.36 uF nominal upper estimate. Effective capacitance at 4.096 V is NOT guaranteed here. Manufacturer characterization data are typical; qualify reference noise/transients on the assembled board. X5R rating limits this component to +85 C. No footprint, pad or net change."
